{"id":97,"slug":"ma-jain-zh","resourceId":56,"nameNative":"马坚译（中文）","nameAr":"ما جيان","nameEn":"Chinese Translation (Ma Jian)","lang":"zh","source":"Quran.com API v4","sourceUrl":"https://quran.com","verses":[{"verseNumber":1,"verseKey":"97:1","text":"我在那高贵的夜间确已降示它,"},{"verseNumber":2,"verseKey":"97:2","text":"你怎能知道那高贵的夜间是什麽？"},{"verseNumber":3,"verseKey":"97:3","text":"那高贵的夜间, 胜过一千个月,"},{"verseNumber":4,"verseKey":"97:4","text":"众天神和精神, 奉他们的主的命令, 为一切事务而在那夜间降临,"},{"verseNumber":5,"verseKey":"97:5","text":"那夜间全是平安的, 直到黎明显著的时侯。"}]}